{"id":99040630551795,"type":"album","name":"Meditations","artist":"John Coltrane","year":1966,"weight":17,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/56500-meditations_174535.jpg","aoty":85,"aoty_user":83,"yt":"TuzfMR-7v1I","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/john-coltrane/meditations","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/56500-john-coltrane-meditations.php"},"desc":"Meditations is a 1966 album by John Coltrane. The album was considered the \"spiritual follow-up to A Love Supreme.\" It features Coltrane and Pharoah Sanders as soloists, both playing tenor saxophones. This was the last Coltrane recording to feature his classic quartet lineup of himself, bassist Jimmy Garrison, drummer Elvin Jones and pianist McCoy Tyner (augmented here as a sextet with Sanders and second drummer Rashied Ali), as both Jones and Tyner would quit the band by early 1966. Sanders, Ali, Garrison and Coltrane's wife Alice would comprise his next group. Alternative versions of tracks 2–5 had been recorded in ."},"artist_ref":{"id":135557885934307,"name":"John Coltrane","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/John_Coltrane_1963_cropped_ver2.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":110972509927513,"type":"genre","name":"Free Jazz","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":251,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":18560543527384,"type":"genre","name":"Avant-Garde Jazz","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":235,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":17868882409397,"type":"genre","name":"Spiritual Jazz","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":206,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":8160780515432,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz — Free Jazz","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":3,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":82023523175048,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz — Spiritual Jazz","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":9,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":27181356951447